         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe have already learned in previous classes that multiplication can be understood as a sum of repeated values. This idea did not appear in only one part of the world.\n\nWhen Dhavit Prem was doing his research to discover the *Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay* method, he also concluded that the Incas had reached this understanding. In this class, we will learn how they probably used the Yupana to multiply.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "343ed072-18f1-45c5-8e3b-6212478b2c84",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "343ed072-18f1-45c5-8e3b-6212478b2c84",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "a62b520a-f443-4d83-ab51-b99c9a46dab8",
