               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Next Step\n\nWe already have three. Since we want to write 3 two times, we now add another marker on three, as shown below.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"yupana-one-row-red-blue-3\"></p>",
               "source": null,
