                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Organizing\n\nAs we learned before, we cannot leave two markers in the same place on the Yupana. This means we need to \"open large\" now: we move one marker to number 1 and another to number 5. This represents the calculation: 3 + 3 = 5 + 1 = 6.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"yupana-one-row-moved-6\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "c1bc5194-424d-47aa-88fe-645a12a2ffa8",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "c1bc5194-424d-47aa-88fe-645a12a2ffa8",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Let Us Think!\n\nIn *Tawantinsuyu*, the region of the Inca Empire, when we multiply, do we do it completely differently from addition?",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "647f9e8b-4c42-46d8-92b3-e77ac1c1d4e3",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "no",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "647f9e8b-4c42-46d8-92b3-e77ac1c1d4e3",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "a62b520a-f443-4d83-ab51-b99c9a46dab8",
               "text": "Prem, Dhavit",
               "page": "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/334520917_TAWA_PUKLLAY_-_LA_ARITMETICA_INCA_DE_RECONOCIMIENTO_DE_FORMAS_Y_MOVIMIENTOS_OPERABLE_EN_PARALELO_Y_QUE_NO_REQUIERE_CALCULOS_NUMERICOS_MENTALES",
