               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Learning Process\n\nMultiplication with the *Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay* method is a continuation of addition. As a consequence, we perform repeated additions while preserving all the knowledge we have gained from addition.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
