               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned that multiplication with the Yupana follows the same logic that we learned from other parts of the world.\n\nWe also reinforced the movements we have learned in previous classes, building new knowledge on top of the previous one.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
